{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ad0364be38ae4b500c823a065612f2efc6d8d60b7e90a69ceb45191240fb0f8", "ja": "（アイドル達が出演した七夕祭りのステージは\n大盛況だったな！　そして、片付けの時間だが……）", "zh": "（偶像们出演的七夕祭典舞台大受欢迎啊！接下来要收拾了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "7039bdaf1266f26a237aea25c27ad8c5d76c32606f08c2f1a5110b72bb54aa07", "ja": "ふんふんふふ～ん♪\n……あ、この短冊かわいい～！", "zh": "哼哼哼哼～♪\n……啊，这张许愿签好可爱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "93c854b0a6af6af5a4d79926369ad910902e56cf035e5f08b6d75259748d7ce9", "ja": "麗花、片付けを手伝ってくれるのは嬉しいけど、\n疲れてるんじゃないか？", "zh": "丽花，你愿意帮忙收拾我很高兴，不过你是不是累了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "92f7ac1c69283c6f585404dbca46033407cdca0b0036e86b6bb1b162a8c50842", "ja": "気にしないでください、{$P$}さん！\n私、会場に飾ってる短冊が気になってて……。", "zh": "别在意，{$P$}先生！\n我只是有点在意会场里装饰的许愿短笺……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "1f54e05e0cced6bc2859dae13c48c9badc8fe0381c4b4a871e34e650446576cf", "ja": "赤いのや青いのや黄色いの……\nとってもカラフルで素敵だなーって。", "zh": "红色的、蓝色的、黄色的……\n特别五彩缤纷，感觉好棒啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a84e7502e14cf0accec29d3789bafe4804e93590e2dabd406b0b8b1d7cfb6db0", "ja": "そうだな。見たいところだけど、今は片付けの時間だ。\n短冊を集めたら、こっちの袋に入れてくれ。", "zh": "是啊。虽然很想看看，不过现在是收拾的时间。\n把短签收集好后，放进这边的袋子里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "183e083bbb885291a36df36844bdf056aa4ffd89bbcddc4a18989f9ef717a464", "ja": "はーい♪　それじゃ、{$P$}さん？\nどちらがたくさん集められるか、競争ですね！", "zh": "好呀♪ 那么，{$P$}先生？我们来比赛看谁收集得多吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2ad2c0869f36c5da28a4f00aa846bb45473298c7ba7c74330746cdeb79488f6c", "ja": "これで会場の短冊は、集められたな。\nそれじゃ、この袋は預かって……。", "zh": "这样会场里的许愿签就收集完了。\n那么，这个袋子我就先收着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "413fd355b98c92ed1af5c2a86103a1a2951e15bab316efe92fda681fd22c4a99", "ja": "あの……その短冊達は、どうするんですか？\nもしかして、あとでこっそり楽しむとか？", "zh": "那个……那些许愿签要怎么处理呢？\n难道说，是要等之后偷偷拿来找乐子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e809cc0d50d25e722f86839ff84c17eedefb1ac2d3cd9a61c293255160bcf44e", "ja": "そんな趣味はないぞ！\nこれは神社に持っていって、燃やしてもらうんだよ。", "zh": "我可没有那种兴趣！\n这些要带到神社去，请他们烧掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "1b757df09f86210d6e4959099a3b27b1e6538655ad67e9c9c97cfe2133991d72", "ja": "えっ！　短冊……燃やしちゃうんですか？\nみんながいっぱい考えたお願いごとなのに……。", "zh": "咦！要把许愿签……烧掉吗？\n明明是大家认真想出来的愿望……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e554ef4fb90bae87a396950d68d92e278f2d161905883fd13189144d05c52185", "ja": "そう言われると、心が痛いな……。でも、お焚き上げと\nいって、煙と一緒に願いを天に届ける方法なんだ。", "zh": "你这么一说，还真让人心疼啊……不过，这叫“焚烧祈愿”，是让愿望随着烟雾一起传达给上天的方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "86b1e9b6660e85bb0eaaefb1562bcd50b8ac287a84713f7c81a9777755277914", "ja": "煙と一緒に願いを……なるほどなるほど。\nうん、とっても素敵な方法ですね♪", "zh": "把愿望和烟一起……原来如此，原来如此。\n嗯，真是非常棒的方法呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "a631d212a51ac2272cf842a4f89837bcf214c8eea8bea7e1edd162edba5bc5b2", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、お星様に一番近い場所で\nお焚き上げしたら、効果抜群かもしれませんね！", "zh": "那么那么，要是在离星星最近的地方焚烧祈愿物，说不定效果会特别好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1014_p", "source_sha256": "91b9133b7dd5d25e343f5cae382e009df7c3550af088f031f9e6851ab1d2c715", "ja": "……お星様に一番近い場所？", "zh": "……离星星最近的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "957e17a508d56249d695fc97b82bfd2b70f4744717016b976b88db03d22ee9eb", "ja": "はい！　高い高ーい山の上にある神社なら、\nお星様に、どうぞ！って届けられると思うんです！", "zh": "是的！如果是位于高高高高的山顶上的神社，我觉得就能把愿望送到星星那里，对它们说“请收下！”了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1879ff81632798446418457fdfdf2de78aa60b3b9b44f73a7166d164f0ff1ae0", "ja": "配達感覚なのは気になるが、大切な願い事には\nいい場所だな。でも、そこまで俺が登れるか……。", "zh": "虽然总觉得像是在送快递，不过那里确实是寄托重要愿望的好地方。只是，我能不能爬到那么高的地方啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0323_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "089b971d46bda12213200aad3c14ab12701249757bb290af538877bc5591d8ee", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ！　私がしっかりサポートしちゃいます。\nだから、みんなの願い……きちんと届けましょうね♪", "zh": "没问题的！我会好好支持您的。\n所以，大家的愿望……一定要好好传达到位哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
